Common ElectronicMail
    documentation "The numbers, letters, and symbols used to identify an electronic mail (e-mail) user within the network to which the individual or organization belongs."
    shared string ElectronicMailAddress
        documentation "The electronic mail (e-mail) address listed for an individual or organization."
        is part of identity
    descriptor ElectronicMailType
        documentation "The type of email listed for an individual or organization. For example: Home/Personal, Work, etc.)"
        is part of identity
    bool PrimaryEmailAddressIndicator
        documentation "An indication that the electronic mail address should be used as the principal electronic mail address for an individual or organization."
        is optional
    bool DoNotPublishIndicator
        documentation "An indication that the electronic email address should not be published."
        is optional